<title>INDONESIA: Putra Surya says H1 net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Putra Surya says H1 net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian finance company Putra Surya Multidana said on Tuesday it posted a first-half net profit of 101.07 billion rupiah, compared with 18.87 billion rupiah in the same 1996 period.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom + 6221 384-6364</p>
